vents in my calendar?\", \"diff thing, what does Community garden spending come to\", \"just the group ones pls\", \"show me my starred files\", \"when's the Rookery Fields thing\"], [\"okay first off, how many to-dos have I still got open?\", \"oh and um, do I have anything in the calendar about Tennis at all?\", \"right, different thing, what's the Community garden group's spending adding up to?\", \"hmm, could you just show me the group ones?\", \"also, can I see the files I starred?\", \"and uh when exactly have I got the Rookery Fields?\"], [\"How many open tasks do I have?\", \"Do I have any calendar events about Tennis?\", \"What does the Community garden group's spending come to?\", \"Can you show just the group ones?\", \"Which files have I starred?\", \"When do I have the Rookery Fields?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-019\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who is coming to the planning?\"], [\"whos coming to the planning\"], [\"Who is attending the planning?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-020\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what is due this week, please?\", \"Separately, would you show me which expenses were over £150?\", \"Which of those relate to the roof, please?\", \"Also, do I have any documents about the Christening?\"], [\"due this week?\", \"expenses over $150\", \"roof ones?\", \"Christening docs?\"], [\"so um what've I got that's due this week?\", \"oh, different thing, which of my expenses went over like 150 quid?\", \"and which of those were for the roof, do you know?\", \"oh and hang on, have I got any documents about the Christening anywhere?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-021\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when I last heard from Keziah Eklund?\", \"On another matter, would you tell me who Umberto is?\", \"Could you narrow those down to the winslow ones, please?\"], [\"last contact with Keziah Eklund?\", \"who's Umberto?\", \"winslow ones only\"], [\"hmm when did I last actually hear from Keziah Eklund, any idea?\", \"oh and um, who's Umberto again? I can never keep track\"